            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/58940794cfd39ef77ca4c97a8e64c109.webp?t=1755992967\" width=314 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>High Score</strong> Mode Defend your self against enemies by collecting ammo to shoot or you can hit randomly generated mystery boxes that spawn across high score mode to play through 10 different frog suits. The suits are temporary so you have to save citizen frogs to increase the suits time or defeat enemies that randomly drop suit gauge boosts. Make sure not to fall in any pits or get hit by objects such as laser beams or asteroids which would cause you to lose a suit upon respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/46d76b736bc16ce102a6388512c608b2.poster.avif?t=1755992967\" width=286 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/46d76b736bc16ce102a6388512c608b2.webm?t=1755992967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/e2db883453aed6d7eee124a57f280a9a.avif?t=1755992967\" width=746 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock up to 4 characters that are also playable in <strong>Story Mode</strong>:  the Jack-O-Lantern, UV Frog, Golden Frog and, or UFO Frog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/f0383ac12efb7d35673f58185f9fdc11.apng?t=1755992967\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/f0383ac12efb7d35673f58185f9fdc11.poster.avif?t=1755992967\" class=\"bb_img\" width=120 height=80 /></picture></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/4466f1b38f8bf6c961fa2f7312dd0379.webp?t=1755992967\" width=20 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Space to jump and shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-W, S, A and D to walk   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/82a442c746ed6b307d4135ca768549af.webp?t=1755992967\" width=209 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/2fce14da40fd41644e5f16ab08cada64.avif?t=1755992967\" width=78 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong> asteroids from space have hit the city.  Jerry Frog must help rescue the citizens, so they can relocate to a safer area.  During his efforts, he   will encounter fires, collapsing buildings, dangerous weather conditions, and unexpected enemies.  Jerry will need to use a water gun to extinguish fires while attempting to rescue citizens from their burning houses.  He will have to leap from building roof to roof seeking anyone in need of help as he tries to avoid falling to his death within the flames below.  Jerry has to balance himself on the fragile buildings that could collapse any second while avoiding other obstacles.  By using physics and proper timing, Jerry can rescue and relocate everyone in need of help.  <strong>&quot;HELP!&quot;</strong> and the distressed citizen disappears once they're rescued and relocated.        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                          </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/58940794cfd39ef77ca4c97a8e64c109.webp?t=1755992967\" width=314 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>High Score</strong> Mode Defend your self against enemies by collecting ammo to shoot or you can hit randomly generated mystery boxes that spawn across high score mode to play through 10 different frog suits. The suits are temporary so you have to save citizen frogs to increase the suits time or defeat enemies that randomly drop suit gauge boosts. Make sure not to fall in any pits or get hit by objects such as laser beams or asteroids which would cause you to lose a suit upon respawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/46d76b736bc16ce102a6388512c608b2.poster.avif?t=1755992967\" width=286 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/46d76b736bc16ce102a6388512c608b2.webm?t=1755992967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/e2db883453aed6d7eee124a57f280a9a.avif?t=1755992967\" width=746 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock up to 4 characters that are also playable in <strong>Story Mode</strong>:  the Jack-O-Lantern, UV Frog, Golden Frog and, or UFO Frog. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/f0383ac12efb7d35673f58185f9fdc11.apng?t=1755992967\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/f0383ac12efb7d35673f58185f9fdc11.poster.avif?t=1755992967\" class=\"bb_img\" width=120 height=80 /></picture></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/4466f1b38f8bf6c961fa2f7312dd0379.webp?t=1755992967\" width=20 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Space to jump and shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-W, S, A and D to walk   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                           <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/82a442c746ed6b307d4135ca768549af.webp?t=1755992967\" width=209 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                            <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/762100/extras/2fce14da40fd41644e5f16ab08cada64.avif?t=1755992967\" width=78 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Story Mode</strong> asteroids from space have hit the city.  Jerry Frog must help rescue the citizens, so they can relocate to a safer area.  During his efforts, he   will encounter fires, collapsing buildings, dangerous weather conditions, and unexpected enemies.  Jerry will need to use a water gun to extinguish fires while attempting to rescue citizens from their burning houses.  He will have to leap from building roof to roof seeking anyone in need of help as he tries to avoid falling to his death within the flames below.  Jerry has to balance himself on the fragile buildings that could collapse any second while avoiding other obstacles.  By using physics and proper timing, Jerry can rescue and relocate everyone in need of help.  <strong>&quot;HELP!&quot;</strong> and the distressed citizen disappears once they're rescued and relocated.        </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
